      <PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>The African Medical Education Fund exists to stably and sustainably support Christian clinical educators in remote &amp; rural parts of Africa.</PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>
      <ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>The AME Fund stands committed to bridging the gap in medical education and healthcare access in Africa. By focusing on remote regions, we empower clinician-educators and help cultivate a more robust healthcare system. In 2023, we successfully awarded scholarships to 27 students, offering them not just financial support, but also the opportunity to return to their communities and facilitate change. Our endowment model ensures that these students are equipped to face the socio-economic challenges of their communities, ultimately transforming the landscape of health care in impoverished areas.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
